Locale.Language, Locale.region and Locale.identifier(.icu, from:) are macOS 13. ClockRegion, FinishedSetup and
Keyboards (the prepared device's language, region and keyboards), and PreparedDeviceBoot's Wi-Fi country (the
Mac's region, from v1.0-2026.10.21), use BigSurCompat's stand-ins: the language code, the region honoring an @rg=
override as Locale.region does, ICU's identifier conversion and likely subtags.
compat-checks compares them with macOS 13's API on CI.

